+    This module implements the ARC firmware boot manager for the Raspberry
+    Pi 2 (the ARM FW\MIPS\JXBOOT.C FwBootSystem): it offers the boot
+    selections of the environment, running a program, and the ARC DOS shell,
+    which takes the place of the Jazz setup program, and executes the chosen
+    one.
+
+    A boot selection is a segment of each of the SYSTEMPARTITION, OSLOADER,
+    OSLOADPARTITION, OSLOADFILENAME, OSLOADOPTIONS and LOADIDENTIFIER
+    variables, separated by semicolons. Its program, the OS loader, is given
+    those variables as arguments and the environment.
